Today,many computers architecture are x64,but previously x86 and x16 were used for designing computers and OSes

x16:its very old architecture,this can create instructions with a length of 16(today,use for embedded computers)
x86:its old architecture,this can create instructions with a length of 32
x64:its today use it architecture,this can create instructions with a length of 64

OSes have several architectures:

Monolithic:its not flexible and modular,but this has vary speed.this structure dosen't have structure
layer-base:its flexible and modular,this has normal speed
Mircrokernel:its very flexible and modular,but this has low speed for process
Hybrid:Combination of the Top architectures

throughout history many OSe were Created,for eaxmple:

OS Name| OS architecture | Base on | 
----------------------------------------------------------
